    "description": "You can keep your target worrying about where the next shot is coming from instead of trying to flee. When you deal damage to an enemy that you have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aimed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Aimed\">Aimed</a> at, the target's speed is reduced to 2 squares, and the target cannot take either a Double <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move\" title=\"Move\">Move</a> Action or use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Run\" title=\"Run\">Run</a> Action until the end of your next turn.<br><br>This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stunning\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stunning\">Stunning</a> effect.",
